{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_51","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"for u in 'https://www.bubhopal.ac.in/' 'https://bubhopal.ac.in/' 'https://www.bubhopal.ac.in/college-list' 'https://bubhopal.ac.in/college-list'; do printf '\\\\nURL: %s\\\\n' \\\"\"'$u\"; curl --insecure -L --fail --silent --show-error --max-time 20 \"$u\" | rg -i -C 2 '\"'Amla|Bhimrao|college|affiliat|Betul|website' | head -80; done\"","aggregated_output":"\nURL: https://www.bubhopal.ac.in/\n                            <li>\r\n                                <span id=\"RptrWhatsNew1_Label1_19\">20</span><span>&nbsp;</span>\r\n                                <a id=\"RptrWhatsNew1_HyperLink1_19\" href=\"../Site/Upload/d562f17c-40d9-479a-96aa-769cf2bff6a8.pdf\" target=\"_blank\">NAAC on the basis of accreditation, the colleges will be provided further affiliation for the session 2025-26</a></li>\r\n                        \r\n                            <li>\r\n--\n        <ul class=\"dropdown-menu\">\r\n          <li>\r\n            <a class=\"dropdown-item\" href=\"../../Site/Upload/Menu/1175_1176_Vice-Chancellor_माननीय कुलपति जी का सन्देश-for website.pdf\">Vice Chancellor</a>\r\n          </li>\r\n          <li>\r\n--\n        <ul class=\"dropdown-menu\">\r\n          <li>\r\n            <a class=\"dropdown-item\" href=\"../../Site/Upload/Menu/1119_1159_CRIM_Profile CRIM for Website updations 2026.pdf\">CRIM</a>\r\n          </li>\r\n        </ul>\r\n--\n          </li>\r\n          <li>\r\n            <a class=\"dropdown-item\" href=\"../../Site/Upload/Menu/1119_1147_Sociology_website social science.pdf\">Sociology</a>\r\n          </li>\r\n          <li>\r\n--\n      </li>\r\n      <li>\r\n        <a class=\"dropdown-item\" href=\"../../Site/Upload/Menu/1638__List-of-affiliated-colleges_EC Meeting - converted.pdf\">List of affiliated colleges</a>\r\n      </li>\r\n    </ul>\r\n--\n      </li>\r\n      <li>\r\n        <a class=\"dropdown-item\" href=\"../../Site/Upload/Menu/1765__Health-Centre_Health center data for BU website-1-3.pdf\">Health Centre</a>\r\n      </li>\r\n      <li class=\"dropdown-submenu\">\r\n--\n          </li>\r\n          <li>\r\n            <a class=\"dropdown-item\" href=\"../../Site/Upload/Menu/1600_1693_MOU-Kings-College-London-UK_MOU Kings College London UK.pdf\">MOU Kings College London UK</a>\r\n          </li>\r\n          <li>\r\n--\n          </li>\r\n          <li>\r\n            <a class=\"dropdown-item\" href=\"../../Site/Upload/Menu/1600_1637_CO-POS_PO-PSO-CO on BU Website.pdf\">CO POS</a>\r\n          </li>\r\n          <li>\r\n--\n<h5 class=\"text-center\">AT A GLANCE</h5>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"messager-msg text-center\">Barkatullah Vishwavidyalaya, formerly known as Bhopal University, was established in 1970 in the capital city of Madhya Pradesh and rechristened in 1988 as Barkatullah Vishwavidyalaya in the living memory of the great freedom fighter Prof. Barkatullah who belonged to Bhopal. The University has been accredited &lsquo;A&rsquo; grade by NAAC in 2025. University campus covering an area of approx. 400 acres of land is located along Hoshangabad highway at a distance of about 3 km from Rani Kamlapati Railway Station.</div>\r\n\r\n<div class=\"text-center mt-2\"><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/bubhopal.ac.in/bbaadmissions/home\" style=\"font-size: 26px; color: red; font-weight: bold; text-decoration: underline;\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000;\"><span style=\"background-color:#00ccff;\">UTD Admissions Notice 2026-27</span></span></a></div>\r\n--\n                \r\n                    <li>\r\n                        <a id=\"NewUpdates1_RptrWhatsNew1_HyperLink1_1\" href=\"../Site/Upload/47ae562f-5e96-41e0-9291-58191391fd10..pdf\" target=\"_blank\">520 Notification for inter college sports tournament 2026 27</a></li>\r\n                \r\n                    <li>\r\n--\n<h2 class=\"section-title\">Welcome to Barkatullah Vishwavidyalaya, Bhopal</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Barkatullah Vishwavidyalaya, formerly known as Bhopal University, was established in 1970 in the capital city of Madhya Pradesh and rechristened in 1988 as Barkatullah Vishwavidyalaya in the living memory of the great freedom fighter Prof. Barkatullah who belonged to Bhopal. The University has been accredited &lsquo;A&rsquo; grade by NAAC in 2025. University campus covering an area of approx. 400 acres of land is located along Hoshangabad highway at a distance of about 3 km from Rani Kamlapati Railway Station. University covers almost full spectrum of higher education, offering courses in its affiliated Colleges and University Teaching Departments in the faculties of Arts, Social Science, Science, Life Science, Engineering, Law, Commerce, Education, Physical Education, Technology, Home Science and Management. Territorial jurisdiction of the university extends to eight districts namely Bhopal, Sehore, Vidisha, Raisen, Narmadapuram, Harda, Betul and Rajgarh.</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div></div>\r\n--\n                <div class=\"v-marquee-item\">\r\n                    <span id=\"SpecialFeature1_RptrWhatsNew1_lbl_img_2\">🎓</span>&nbsp;\r\n                    <a id=\"SpecialFeature1_RptrWhatsNew1_lnkmore1_2\" href=\"../Controls/WebSiteControls/sites.google.com/bubhopal.ac.in/convocation-2022-23/home\" target=\"_blank\">ABC</a>\r\n                </div>\r\n            \r\n--\n                        <div id=\"FooterMenu1_bottomLinks\" class=\"bottomLinks\" role=\"Footer Navigation\"><ul class=\"menu two-columns\">\r\n  <li>\r\n    <a target=\"_blank\" title=\"External Website that opens in a new window\" href=\"https://sites.google.com/bubhopal.ac.in/university-act-ordinancestatut/home\">University Act Ordinance Statutes</a>\r\n  </li>\r\n  <li>\r\n    <a target=\"_blank\" title=\"External Website that opens in a new window\" href=\"https://forms.easebuzz.in/sign-up/Barkatullah7R5DR/Barkatullah_Vishwavidyalaya_Bhopal/?inst_name=Barkatullah7R5DR&amp;form_name=Barkatullah_Vishwa